BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:wo-upperA@kaoyan
SUMMARY:🏋️ 上肢A
DESCRIPTION:【周一】上肢A · 推为主+水平拉 65min\n1. 杠铃卧推 4×6-8 (20→35-40kg)\n2. 坐姿划船 4×8-10 (33-40kg)\n3. 上斜哑铃卧推 4×8-10 (12.5kg)\n4. 宽距高位下拉 3×8-10 (32.5-40kg)\n5. 哑铃侧平举 3×12-15 递减组\n6. 直杆绳索下压 3×10-12 (26-33kg)\n练后：爬坡20min 坡度12/速度4-5
DTSTART;TZID=Asia/Shanghai:20260622T123500
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=MO
DURATION:PT1H5M
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:wo-lowerA@kaoyan
SUMMARY:🏋️ 下肢A
DESCRIPTION:【周二】下肢A · 蹲为主 65min\n1. 杠铃深蹲 4×6-8 (空杆→50-65kg)\n2. 罗马尼亚硬拉 4×8-10 (25kg)\n3. 腿举 3×8-10 (80-100kg)\n4. 坐姿腿弯举 3×10-12 (26kg)\n5. 坐姿髋外展 3×12-15 (33kg)\n6. 哈克机提踵 3×12-15\n练后：爬坡20min 坡度12/速度4-5
DTSTART;TZID=Asia/Shanghai:20260622T123500
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=TU
DURATION:PT1H5M
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:wo-upperB@kaoyan
SUMMARY:🏋️ 上肢B
DESCRIPTION:【周四】上肢B · 拉为主+肩推 65min\n1. 站姿杠铃推举 4×6-8 (15-20kg)\n2. T杆划船(窄) 4×8-10 (20-25kg)\n3. 把手式蝴蝶机飞鸟 3×10-12 (26-39kg)\n4. 单手悍马机划船 3×8-10 (15-20kg单边)\n5. 面拉 3×12-15 (26-32.5kg)\n6. 哑铃侧平举 3×12-15 递减组\n7. 哑铃弯举 3×8-12 (7.5kg)\n练后：爬坡20min 坡度12/速度4-5
DTSTART;TZID=Asia/Shanghai:20260622T123500
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=TH
DURATION:PT1H5M
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:wo-lowerB@kaoyan
SUMMARY:🏋️ 下肢B
DESCRIPTION:【周五】下肢B · 髋铰链为主 65min\n1. 罗马尼亚硬拉 4×6-8 (25-30kg)\n2. 哈克机早安 4×8-10 (80-100kg)\n3. 坐姿腿屈伸 3×10-12 (26-33kg)\n4. 坐姿髋内收 3×12-15 (26-44kg)\n5. 山羊挺身 3×10-12 (自重/抱片)\n6. 卷腹/悬垂举腿 3×15-20\n练后：爬坡20min 坡度12/速度4-5
DTSTART;TZID=Asia/Shanghai:20260622T123500
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=FR
DURATION:PT1H5M
END:VEVENT
